n South Korea as defectors from Kim Jong-un=E2=80=99s regime. We know much =
about the pair, including the fact that they will probably never see their =
families again. But their fate is also teaching us more about the complex g=
lobal character of a war on the edge of Europe. <a href=3D"https://link.the=
